[{"text": "We shall now continue the general", "start": 5.839, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "debate.", "start": 7.759, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 10.4, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "excellency Timokle Kon, Vice President", "start": 13.599, "duration": 8.281}, {"text": "of the Republic of Kotivvoir.", "start": 18.0, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 24.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 26.48, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 29.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President of the 81st session of the", "start": 52.239, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly,", "start": 55.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "your excellencies,", "start": 58.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "heads of state and government,", "start": 60.239, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General of the United", "start": 63.12, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Nations, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 65.119, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "on behalf of his excellency Mr. Alasan", "start": 69.439, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Watara, President of the Republic of", "start": 72.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Kotivvoir and of the government and", "start": 74.799, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "people of Kotivvoir.", "start": 77.04, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "I wish to extend our warm", "start": 79.36, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "congratulations to the president of the", "start": 80.96, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "general assembly on his election to", "start": 83.119, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "preside over the 81st session of our", "start": 85.04, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "organization and to assure him of Kat", "start": 87.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Divvoir's full support in the discharge", "start": 90.479, "duration": 7.401}, {"text": "of his important mandate.", "start": 93.52, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "And as his tenure draws to a close, I", "start": 100.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "would also like to pay a heartfelt", "start": 104.72, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "tribute to the Secretary General of the", "start": 106.32, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "United Nations, Mr. Antonio Gutish.", "start": 108.24, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "Over the past decade,", "start": 112.159, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "he has exercised his high office with", "start": 114.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "profound humanity", "start": 117.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and absolute fidelity to the ideals of", "start": 120.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the charter of the United Nations in an", "start": 123.04, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "international context that has been", "start": 125.04, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "among the most trying in the", "start": 126.88, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "contemporary history of our", "start": 128.64, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 130.399, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Kot Divvoir wishes to express its deep", "start": 132.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "gratitude to him for the excellence of", "start": 136.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "our cooperation which has grown stronger", "start": 139.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "throughout his term.", "start": 141.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 144.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "President Alasan Watara has asked me to", "start": 147.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "convey to you his warmest regards", "start": 150.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "grounded in high esteem and friendship", "start": 152.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "as well as his sincere wishes for", "start": 155.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "success in the next chapters of your", "start": 157.519, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "distinguished career.", "start": 160.239, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies, ladies and", "start": 163.92, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 166.4, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "this session is taking place against a", "start": 169.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "deeply troubling international backdrop.", "start": 172.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Conflicts and hotspots of tension are", "start": 175.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "multiplying and geopolitical divisions", "start": 177.44, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "are deepening", "start": 179.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "while the rise of terrorism and violent", "start": 182.319, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "extremism", "start": 184.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "threatens an ever growing number of", "start": 186.72, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "regions.", "start": 188.72, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "At the same time, climate upheavalss", "start": 190.239, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "are hitting our countries hard, not to", "start": 194.239, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "mention the humanitarian crises and deep", "start": 197.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "inequalities that are weakening our", "start": 199.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "societies. Added to this are the very", "start": 201.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "real risks to the survival of humanity", "start": 204.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "posed by the uncontrolled development of", "start": 207.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 210.56, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "The world", "start": 213.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "is thus at a difficult turning point.", "start": 215.599, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "It is looking on", "start": 220.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "at the gradual fragmentation of its", "start": 223.44, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "peace architecture and an alarming", "start": 225.28, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "reconfiguration of the international", "start": 228.159, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "landscape.", "start": 229.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Before our very eyes, multilateralism", "start": 231.92, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "is being sorely tested, weakened by an", "start": 235.36, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "erosion of trust between nations", "start": 239.12, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and", "start": 243.04, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "trust in the institutions that underpin", "start": 244.64, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the world order.", "start": 246.64, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "In these times of multilateral fracture,", "start": 249.04, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "it is imperative to find appropriate", "start": 251.04, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "solutions", "start": 253.439, "duration": 4.001}, {"text": "to put an end to these dangerous", "start": 254.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "escalations, prioritize dialogue, and", "start": 257.44, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "rebuild trust.", "start": 261.12, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "With regard to inst international", "start": 264.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "institutions, this trust is measured by", "start": 265.919, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "their ability to translate", "start": 269.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the universality of their principles", "start": 272.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "into concrete actions and to treat every", "start": 274.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "state large or small with the same", "start": 277.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "standard of fairness.", "start": 280.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The trust of peoples for its part", "start": 283.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "is nourished by tangible results and by", "start": 286.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the certainty that the decisions taken", "start": 289.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "on their behalf genuinely serve their", "start": 292.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "security, their dignity, and protect", "start": 296.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "their future.", "start": 298.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "This year's theme, therefore, aptly", "start": 301.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "captures the expectations of our time.", "start": 303.44, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "It calls on us specifically to restore", "start": 307.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "trust in our collective capacity", "start": 311.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to respond effectively to global", "start": 315.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "challenges", "start": 317.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and to support the current changes and", "start": 319.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "reforms of the United Nations", "start": 322.4, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "architecture", "start": 323.84, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "so that our organization", "start": 325.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "is once again able to deliver concrete", "start": 328.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "solutions to the concerns of all", "start": 332.16, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "peoples.", "start": 334.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "For Kivvoir,", "start": 337.199, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "this means reinvigorating", "start": 339.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 342.08, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "and consequently", "start": 344.32, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "restoring diplomacy's rightful place and", "start": 348.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "credibility", "start": 351.52, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "so that it can act effectively.", "start": 353.199, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "In light of these challenges, a", "start": 357.68, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "monumental task awaits the next", "start": 359.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Secretary General of the United Nations,", "start": 361.759, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "whose selection process is now well", "start": 365.199, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "underway.", "start": 366.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Kivvar hopes that this process will", "start": 368.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "result in the appointment of a figure of", "start": 372.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the highest caliber", "start": 374.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "whose moral values,", "start": 376.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "independence of mind, diplomatic", "start": 379.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "experience", "start": 382.8, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "and commitment to dialogue will enable", "start": 384.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the United Nations to pursue with", "start": 386.319, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "ambition and effectiveness its mission", "start": 388.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "in the service of peace, development,", "start": 390.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and solidarity among nations.", "start": 393.84, "duration": 8.68}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 397.6, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "current international events remind us", "start": 402.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "every day of the human, political and", "start": 404.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "economic cost of protracted conflicts.", "start": 408.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Kivvoir remains deeply concerned about", "start": 411.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the resumption of hostilities in the", "start": 414.88, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "near Middle East,", "start": 416.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the consequences of which weigh on peace", "start": 419.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "and on food, energy, and economic", "start": 421.44, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "security throughout the world.", "start": 425.44, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "The dire situation in the", "start": 429.599, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "east of the Democratic Republic of the", "start": 433.759, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "Congo and in the Sudan is equally", "start": 436.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "alarming with severe and endless", "start": 438.4, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "humanitarian consequences.", "start": 442.16, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "All these persistent conflicts are", "start": 446.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "exacerbating the suffering of the", "start": 448.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "affected populations and producing", "start": 451.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "harmful effects that extend far beyond", "start": 454.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the borders of the states concerned.", "start": 457.039, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "We therefore call for dialogue to", "start": 461.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "prevail over arms.", "start": 463.599, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "We", "start": 467.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "also express our solidarity with the", "start": 469.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Haitian people.", "start": 473.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Kotivar will continue to contribute to", "start": 475.599, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "ongoing initiatives aimed at supporting", "start": 477.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the Haitian authorities and", "start": 480.639, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "international partners", "start": 482.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in order to restore security in the", "start": 485.599, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "sister nation so as to restore", "start": 488.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "democratic legitimacy to its", "start": 490.319, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "institutions.", "start": 492.16, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "My country", "start": 497.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "takes this opportunity to reaffirm its", "start": 499.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "commitment to the peaceful settlement of", "start": 501.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "disputes in accordance with the United", "start": 503.68, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "Nations charter", "start": 506.24, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "and to lend its full support for the", "start": 510.08, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "many mediation efforts undertaken by the", "start": 512.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "United Nations, the African Union and", "start": 515.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "relevant regional organizations.", "start": 518.0, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 520.8, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "Africa is bearing the brunt of the", "start": 524.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "decline of multilateralism and the", "start": 526.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "difficulties the United Nations has", "start": 530.399, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "faced in recent years.", "start": 532.32, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "Due to a lack of support from certain", "start": 537.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "partners", "start": 539.519, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "and from the United Nations,", "start": 541.519, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "several African countries are struggling", "start": 543.92, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "to find lasting solutions to conflicts", "start": 546.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and to bear the cost of various", "start": 548.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "counterterrorism and peacekeeping", "start": 551.04, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "operations.", "start": 553.2, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "Meanwhile,", "start": 555.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "violent extremism,", "start": 557.519, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "transnational organized crime,", "start": 560.24, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "and elicit trafficking of all kinds", "start": 565.12, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "continue to destabilize", "start": 570.08, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "a number of regions on the continent and", "start": 573.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "in particular the Sahel.", "start": 575.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Our experience and the realities on the", "start": 578.32, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "ground", "start": 580.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "demonstrate that no state", "start": 582.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "can on its own", "start": 585.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "overcome such threats in a definitive", "start": 589.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and lasting manner. This requires", "start": 591.839, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "greater regional cooperation and", "start": 594.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international solidarity in order to", "start": 595.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "ensure appropriate responses. These", "start": 598.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "threats", "start": 602.959, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "also call for investment in conflict", "start": 605.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "prevention", "start": 608.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and for addressing at an early stage the", "start": 610.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "vulnerabilities that fuel crisis", "start": 613.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "including poverty, inequality,", "start": 616.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "youth unemployment", "start": 620.0, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and all other forms of marginalization.", "start": 623.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "In this regard, we commend the efforts", "start": 626.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "of the United Nations, the African", "start": 629.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Union, Echoas,", "start": 631.44, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "and all the partners", "start": 633.68, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "working on security and stabilization", "start": 637.839, "duration": 6.841}, {"text": "efforts in our region.", "start": 640.959, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "If these institutions are to be as", "start": 644.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "effective as expected, they must", "start": 647.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "therefore become more representative,", "start": 650.32, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "more inclusive,", "start": 652.0, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "and better attuned to the demands of our", "start": 653.839, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "time.", "start": 656.079, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "Indeed,", "start": 658.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "it is becoming increasingly difficult to", "start": 660.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "explain to younger generations", "start": 663.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "that organizations created in the", "start": 666.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "aftermath of the Second World War can no", "start": 668.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "longer faithfully reflect the political,", "start": 671.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "demographic, and e economic realities of", "start": 674.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the 21st century.", "start": 677.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "My country once again reaffirms its", "start": 679.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "support for an ambitious reform of the", "start": 681.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Security Council.", "start": 684.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "so as to ensure permanent representation", "start": 687.519, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "for Africa in this important body whose", "start": 689.92, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "decisions directly affect our peace and", "start": 693.6, "duration": 6.679}, {"text": "security.", "start": 697.279, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "That is why Kivvoir welcomes the", "start": 700.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "progress achieved through the pact for", "start": 704.16, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "the future", "start": 706.16, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "and calls for its swift implementation.", "start": 709.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "The real challenge", "start": 713.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "is no longer to adopt new commitments,", "start": 715.839, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "but rather to translate those already", "start": 719.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "made into tangible results for the", "start": 722.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "greater well-being of our peoples.", "start": 724.64, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 728.88, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "there can be no lasting peace without", "start": 733.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "truly inclusive and equitable", "start": 738.0, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "development.", "start": 740.079, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "As the 2030 deadline approaches,", "start": 743.92, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "progress towards achieving the", "start": 748.48, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "sustainable development goals remains", "start": 750.079, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "insufficient", "start": 751.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "while financing needs remain", "start": 754.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "considerable in many developing", "start": 756.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "countries.", "start": 758.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "The fourth international conference on", "start": 761.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "financing for development", "start": 763.2, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "rightly recalled that the necessary", "start": 766.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "resources exist.", "start": 769.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "The challenge now", "start": 773.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "lies in our collective ability to", "start": 775.68, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "mobilize them and to channel them with", "start": 779.519, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "greater equity, solidarity, and", "start": 784.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "effectiveness", "start": 786.88, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "in the service of sustainable", "start": 789.04, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "development.", "start": 790.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Kivvoir therefore calls for an ambitious", "start": 793.12, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "reform of the international financial", "start": 795.839, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "architecture", "start": 797.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "and a renewed global partnership", "start": 800.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to ensure that developing countries have", "start": 804.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "more equitable equitable access to the", "start": 806.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "resources needed to finance", "start": 809.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "infrastructure, health,", "start": 810.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "education,", "start": 813.519, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "energy,", "start": 815.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "industrial", "start": 819.6, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "transformation. information and the", "start": 821.44, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "creation of decent jobs for young", "start": 822.72, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "people.", "start": 825.04, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Climate challenges require a similar", "start": 828.959, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "degree of mobilization.", "start": 831.04, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "Africa contributes the least to global", "start": 835.12, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "green gas greenhouse gas emissions, yet", "start": 837.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "remains among the regions most hit the", "start": 839.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "hardest by their consequences.", "start": 842.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Droughts, floods, land degradation, and", "start": 844.88, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "the disruption of food systems", "start": 848.16, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "directly threaten the ways of life and", "start": 853.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "the livelihoods of millions of people.", "start": 855.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "In this context,", "start": 859.199, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "honoring international commitments on", "start": 861.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "climate finance, adaptation, and", "start": 863.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "technology transfer is an imperative of", "start": 866.32, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "justice and solidarity.", "start": 869.68, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 873.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the transformation that our world is", "start": 877.839, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "experiencing is also a technological", "start": 879.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "one. Artificial intelligence and the", "start": 881.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "digital revolution", "start": 884.399, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "are opening up opening up considering", "start": 886.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "opportunities in many areas of our", "start": 888.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "contemporary world.", "start": 891.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "However, these technological advances", "start": 894.079, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "can also exacerbate existing divides", "start": 897.279, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "if their development as well as access", "start": 902.32, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "to them remain unevenly distributed.", "start": 904.639, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "In this regard, Kot Dvar supports the", "start": 910.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "efforts of the United Nations to promote", "start": 912.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "the global governance of artificial", "start": 915.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "intelligence that fosters innovation", "start": 917.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "while protecting human dignity,", "start": 921.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "international security, and sustainable", "start": 924.56, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "development", "start": 926.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "in a spirit of inclusion, ethics, and", "start": 928.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "equitable sharing of the benefits of", "start": 930.959, "duration": 6.281}, {"text": "technological progress.", "start": 933.519, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 937.36, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "the trust that we seek at the", "start": 941.36, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "international level must also be built", "start": 943.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "within each of our states", "start": 944.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "through the strength of our institutions", "start": 948.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and our ability to create the conditions", "start": 951.92, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "for", "start": 954.0, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "sustainable and shared development.", "start": 955.519, "duration": 4.361}, {"text": "My country for its part", "start": 960.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "under the leadership of President Alasan", "start": 963.839, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Guara continues on its path towards a", "start": 965.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "stronger and more diversified economy", "start": 968.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "while taking care to ensure and", "start": 971.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "safeguard peace and stability.", "start": 974.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "This ambition is now embodied in Kot", "start": 977.199, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Divvar's national development plan 2026", "start": 979.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "2030", "start": 982.959, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "which is part of a long-term vision", "start": 984.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "aligned with the 2030 agenda for", "start": 986.959, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "sustainable development", "start": 990.88, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "and the African Union's agenda 2063.", "start": 993.199, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "Our ambition remains to build a", "start": 997.92, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "prosperous and united nation where", "start": 999.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "economic growth translates into greater", "start": 1002.639, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "opportunity,", "start": 1005.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "social progress and well-being for all", "start": 1006.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of our people.", "start": 1010.0, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1012.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "as the United Nations enters its ninth", "start": 1016.399, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "decade of existence,", "start": 1019.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "we have a collective duty to demonstrate", "start": 1022.639, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "that multilateralism", "start": 1026.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "remains the best response to the", "start": 1029.52, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "challenges of our time.", "start": 1031.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "We must choose dialogue over", "start": 1034.559, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "confrontation,", "start": 1036.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "cooperation over isolation,", "start": 1038.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "and solidarity over indifference.", "start": 1041.6, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "We must restore trust among nations,", "start": 1045.199, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "ensure that the rule of law prevails", "start": 1050.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "over the use of force, place human", "start": 1053.52, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "beings at the heart of our decisions,", "start": 1055.2, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "and", "start": 1056.799, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "make our diversity a source of strength", "start": 1058.32, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "rather than a cause for division.", "start": 1061.52, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Only then will the United Nations", "start": 1065.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "continue", "start": 1069.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to embody the hopes of peoples and", "start": 1071.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "fulfill the promises that led to its", "start": 1074.72, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "creation.", "start": 1077.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Kivoir true to its values and firmly", "start": 1080.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "committed to peace, dialogue and", "start": 1084.48, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 1086.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "will continue with humility but with", "start": 1089.52, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "determination", "start": 1092.08, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "to contribute to this collective", "start": 1093.679, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "endeavor", "start": 1095.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "because we believe that the destiny of", "start": 1097.039, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "humanity", "start": 1100.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "remains profoundly shared. Finally, it", "start": 1102.799, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "is incumbent upon us to ensure that the", "start": 1105.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "United Nations remains for present and", "start": 1107.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "future generations", "start": 1111.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "a true crucible of human dignity", "start": 1113.52, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "and the guarantor of a better world. I", "start": 1117.84, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "thank you", "start": 1121.039, "duration": 3.241}, {"text": ">> on behalf of the general assembly. I", "start": 1130.32, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "thank the vice president of the republic", "start": 1132.559, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "of Kotivvoir.", "start": 1134.559, "duration": 3.161}]